      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LONDON (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 17.82. Nicely placed here on the inside and has a good record over this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from seven starts. Can make it back-to-back wins. CADILLAC RAGTOP (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.57 beating Cantara Pearl. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Must be included in calculations. SWEET EDNA (4) hit the ground running off the cherry draw and never headed winning (17.55) at this track in Grade 6 over 305m. Fast beginner who should quickly stride to the lead. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Sure to be thereabouts. SAINT BREE (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
